Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs82\bord3\shad3\blur10\fad(400,1000)\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&HBF5A4E&\4c&H9E7560&\pos(474,912)}#07 睦月始探险队	
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那座桥不是来回岛上唯一的路吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在烧毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.76,0:02:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被困在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 所有人都安然无恙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之有没有离开这座岛的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听得到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们暂时没办法从岛上脱身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没办法从外界取得联系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种情况该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得确保基本生存
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是现在停电了  手机也打不通呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煤气罐装还有剩下的  应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屋顶上有水箱  用完之前我们水源应该一直有保障
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少会持续一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食物的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚饭做了咖哩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写给所有善良的孩子 不要喂兔子咖喱 睦月始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是你？ ！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我站住了  黑田
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 本来还很期待阳的盛夏咖哩的说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上  我对今天的手艺本来还蛮有自信的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田  你真是有个超级大胃王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是把每个人的随身点心和食物资源收集起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一晚上应该能撑过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  万一紧急时刻的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春  不要这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办呢  只是一晚上的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得都坐在这里等最好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去雨好像停了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面风还是很大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不妙啊这样所有水都要没了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧用什么堵住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然应急堵了下  可是水还是在漏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道能撑多久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况有点严重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先找点容器  把水储存进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:05:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定以后再看看屋里有没有能修好水箱的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这些锅洗下就能储水了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  小矮子们？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有什么奇怪的声音！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来像是树枝被踩断  然后什么东西在靠近这里的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大风而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然就是风啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛  真会吓唬人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是刚才的确有让人害怕的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能那也是风吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确听到像什么动物发出的嚎叫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有树枝碎裂的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像什么大型古代生物穿过树林  踩断了树似的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,郁君 不要说了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确就像是听到那种声音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人不想靠近的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个非常巨大的未知之物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在大厅听不到任何声音呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪电 停电 坏掉的水箱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还有怪物……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是有趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隼  别以为这很有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉会有出乎意料的事情发生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那声嚎叫会不会是黑田发出的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？黑田叫的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来  黑田呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说它被那个怪物吃了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  至少有了生存的水源了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上应该会有援救  所以我们得想办法活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好我提前买了点零食当储备
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我们能离开这座岛后 再去买一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找黑田吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 虽然它引发了很多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我把它带出来也有部分责任
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就一起找它嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用  没事  总之我一个人先去找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 始
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是我们现在在的屋子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是桥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.29,0:07:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这座岛后面有一个码头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田可能在那里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,码头的话  应该有许多船的修理工具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就去找修理工具 顺便找黑田怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 那我们分头去码头好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 一定要组队
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是自然
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做最好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责穿过森林到达码头的路线
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去稍微有点绕  沿着海岸线行动的是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成员要怎么分配呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让海先修理房顶的蓄水池
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  我先用这里现有的工具尝试修理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:53.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的就公平的抽签决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 和驱一组吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:09:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\fs96\bord3\pos(960,774)\3c&H0D0D0E&\4c&H4C494B&}翻山队
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  有什么不满吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是不满啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是拜托你这次不要发挥你的不幸体质才好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有始前辈在的话 我的不幸体质也会消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙还真是乐观啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们这边看来是谨慎派的一队了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1800)\fs96\bord3\pos(960,774)\3c&H0D0D0E&\4c&H4C494B&}海岸穿越队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事先定一个限定时间吧 直到那个时间还有哪一队还没到码头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.95,0:09:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再分一队沿另一条路线回别墅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一遇到了不测另一个队也能平安获救呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是春前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其余的队员就给海帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs80\fn腾祥范笑歌楷书简繁合集}紧急企划！Gravi Procella
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们录制组通过当地少年们的证言
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始出发去寻找巨大生物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  没想到遇到了意料外的困难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看  那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs80\fn腾祥范笑歌楷书简繁合集}挡在Gravi Procella前的巨大生物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs80\fn腾祥范笑歌楷书简繁合集}孤岛森林中回响的迷之声
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs80\fn腾祥范笑歌楷书简繁合集}成员们能否存活下来呢！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(708,966,708,1074)\t(0,850,\clip(708,966,1282,1074))}My name is Ren
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(688,966,708,1074)\t(0,850,\clip(688,966,1382,1074))}once upon a time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(708,966,708,1074)\t(0,850,\clip(708,966,1282,1074))}This is a pen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(708,966,708,1074)\t(0,850,\clip(708,966,1282,1074))}How much
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(708,966,708,1074)\t(0,450,\clip(708,966,1282,1074))}please
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(570,966,708,1074)\t(0,900,\clip(570,966,1482,1074))}I'm don't not ear reading
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(708,966,708,1074)\t(0,450,\clip(708,966,1200,1074))}嘎巴  嘎巴的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(360,966,708,1074)\t(0,850,\clip(360,966,1482,1074))}OK Turnleft and go straight please
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们摄制组 深入到有巨大生物叫声的森林中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底巨大生物真的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,始队长想着这次探险中决不能让任何人受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四周是毫无光亮的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一步一步谨慎的前行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后  突然我们眼前出现了奇异的光景
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树枝折断了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音曾听到过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个看起来是刚折断的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,始前辈  要小心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便如此  也不能傻站在森林入口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们摄制组更加小心走到了森林的更深处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大自然的道路险峻  好像在阻止我们的前进
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮被挡住  隐藏在一片黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的智慧毫无用处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泥泞且高低不平的道路不断的夺走着我们的体力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经到极限了 还是回去比较好吧 大家这样想着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然  我们眼前出现了一个巨大的洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是否就是巨大生物的巢穴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而目  突然消失的驱是否平安无事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱从这里掉下去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱的不幸程度还真是让是尊敬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你还活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:13:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了下面有枯草垫着  没有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.53,0:13:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好像是地图上标注的隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\c&HE7E7FA&\1a&H3A&\pos(1442,514)\frx0\fry350}禁止通行\N有塌方危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地面腐化了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有绳梯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:21.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种时侯  真希望驱的倒霉模式不要开启呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不想有这种命运啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦  好了你先上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是没救了 驱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,始前辈 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:13:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隧道有可能塌陷  就没有别的逃生路线了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面有地板的地方就是不会崩塌的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向里直走的话也许会有通往地上的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 从里面有风吹过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是通往什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.94,0:14:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从这里爬到上直去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经确认过了沿着我上来的路线爬上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个 上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事这股风
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们之前听到的吼声就是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那里传来的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样很危险的 驱快上来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强风又吹来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋要是在这里放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.19,0:15:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在女孩子那里人气会暴跌哟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百倍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那一瞬间吓死我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是那阵风是怎么回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨大怪物脚步声的真相是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是为了风力发电建造的建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来已经被废弃了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏了后就一直就没用的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风车被锁链子绕住了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强风刮断了坏了的锁链子 风车就会转起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后风通过隧道时就会发出声响
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来就像怪物的嚎叫了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树被压到的声音是隧道崩落下来的岩石造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是害怕声音不能出去想在这里躲起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正所谓耳听为虚眼见为实
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思说真相没有想象中的那么夸张啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,码头在眼前了我们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于到了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑田君也是  没事真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有船呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在  那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为刚才的大雨绳子松了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照这样下去好像会飘老远去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种距离还能追的上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点累啊  不过还差一点了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.35,0:19:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是海前辈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,始你们离开了之后我找到了新的地图
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一条不用通过森林能到达港口的路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些鱼是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,存放物有放着鱼叉  我就借过来用了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可以尽情的捕鱼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之这么多的话 男人12人也够吃了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我是睦月  是 全员没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了 让你担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是月城先生  马上就有船来这个岛了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那要把这些鱼吃完哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运动了太多 肚子好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想好好展现一下帅气的一面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉全让海表现了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿着 鱼已经烤好了  哦 很好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的探险没有一个人受伤 平安结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然还没有确认到巨大生物的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但大自然的模样  远远超越了我们摄影组的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许会像这次探险一样  在别的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现第一 第二 第三 个巨生物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们不会止步不前 我们会努力解决这世界上所有的谜团
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.59,0:21:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睦月始探险团将会一直继续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀抱这样的期望  我们摄影组离开了这座岛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs80\fn腾祥范笑歌楷书简繁合集}迷之月球表面下的UFO\N\N巨大外星人真的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs80\fn腾祥范笑歌楷书简繁合集}敬请期待
